[183.456239, "o", "Help on function map_value in module bytewax.operators:\r\n\r\nmap_value(step_id: str, up: bytewax.dataflow.Stream[typing.Tuple[str, ~V]], mapper: Callable[[~V], ~W]) -> bytewax.dataflow.Stream[typing.Tuple[str, ~W]]\r\n    Transform values one-by-one.\r\n\r\n    ```{testcode}\r\n    from bytewax.dataflow import Dataflow\r\n    import bytewax.operators as op\r\n    from bytewax.testing import TestingSource\r\n\r\n    flow = Dataflow(\"map_eg\")\r\n\r\n    nums = op.input(\"nums\", flow, TestingSource([1, 2, 3]))\r\n\r\n    mapped = op.map(\"double\", nums, lambda x: x * 2)\r\n\r\n    op.inspect(\"out\", mapped)\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n    ```{testcode}\r\n    :hide:\r\n    from bytewax.testing import run_main\r\n    run_main(flow)\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n    ```{testoutput}\r\n    map_eg.out: 2\r\n    map_eg.out: 4\r\n    map_eg.out: 6\r\n    ```\r\n"]
